# Sema needs exactly ONE of the following. See lib/chat-config.ts.

# Option A — talk to Anthropic directly. Preferred for local development.
# https://console.anthropic.com/settings/keys
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Option B — route through the Vercel AI Gateway instead. On a Vercel
# deployment this is automatic via OIDC and needs no value here; the gateway
# does require a card on file to release its free credits.
# AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY=
